{"kind": "mod", "id": 1853, "name": "StatTrack", "slug": "stattrack", "teaser": "Ever wanted to know how many kills and headshots you have with a specific weapon? Now you can. All weapons will individually track their kills and headshots and display on the info screen for the weapon. See how many you can rack up before you die!", "owner_name": "acidphantasm", "downloads": 42103, "favourites": 42, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.acidphantasm.stattrack", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Tools", "category_id": 1, "updated_at": "2026-08-07T18:02:18.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-11-26T15:10:36.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-11-26T15:10:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "2.1.1", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>Tarkov already tracks your total weapon class kills, but not individual weapons, nor weapon class headshots. Now you can track how well you do with that specific weapon before you lose it. Get that infinite KD, cause when you die and lose your weapon - it’s gone and so are its stats.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Tp81BtT.png\" alt=\"Tp81BtT.png\" /></p>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download StatTrack</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT &amp; BepInEx folders in the zip file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT &amp; BepInEx folders from 7-zip into your SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3N6gTe2.gif\" alt=\"3N6gTe2.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><hr />\n<ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/Bepinex/plugins/acidphantasm-stattrack</code></li>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-stattrack</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">FIKA COMPATIBILITY</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>StatTrack is compatible with Fika.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Do not install the Bepinex side of this mod on the Fika Headless client, it will not load.</li>\n<li>All clients should have it, but it is not required for all clients to have.</li>\n<li>The Fika Server must have the StatTrack Server side of the mod installed.</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">RECOMMENDED MODS</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2339/preview-sizer\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">PreviewSizer</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Will allow you to adjust the size of the preview window for weapons, so weapons with a lot of attachments don’t get pushed off screen</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2101/spt-leaderboard\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT Leaderboard</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Uses StatTrack stats if it’s also installed for your leaderboard profile</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">SUPPORT</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Please comment on the hub page, or preferably create an issue on the GitHub, or <em>more</em> preferably visit #acidphantasm-mods in the SPT Discord!</p></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 5265, "published_at": "2024-11-26T15:10:36.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1853/stattrack/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 7667, "published_at": "2025-01-05T09:54:34.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1853/stattrack/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1228, "published_at": "2025-03-15T20:26:49.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1853/stattrack/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 534, "published_at": "2025-03-21T07:55:43.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1853/stattrack/1.2.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 14847, "published_at": "2025-03-21T20:30:17.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1853/stattrack/1.2.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.2", "content_length": 15690, "downloads": 11703, "published_at": "2025-10-31T19:21:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1853/stattrack/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.1.0", "spt_version_c